# Keep secrets and runtime state out of the operator image build contexts.
# BOTH docker-operator images build with the context rooted here:
#   - docker-operator/Dockerfile        (the operator binary; COPYs docker-operator/)
#   - docker-operator/agent/Dockerfile  (the agent image; COPYs claude-code/** +
#                                        docker-operator/agent/**)
# Neither COPYs any path below, so this is a backstop: a stray .env / credentials
# file / audit log can never land in a build context or an image layer.
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.example
credentials.yaml
config.yaml
dependaproxy.yaml
data/
docker-operator/data/
docker-operator/.env
docker-operator/bin/
docker-operator/cover.out
docker-operator/.quickstart-artifacts/
.ollama/
.claude/
code/
setup-ubuntu-host.sh
scripts/
README.md
readme.md
